Package: fuxi-geoclue
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: fuxi port <noreply@localhost>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: geoclue-2.0 (= 2.7.2-2ubuntu3), systemd, @DEPENDS@
Description: GeoClue GPS RAW support for Xiaomi 13 (fuxi)
 Uses measured horizontal accuracy and full UTC from the fuxi ModemManager
 location dictionary. Keeps the distribution configuration, authorization
 policy, service sandbox and executable path using a service-local bind mount.
